"""Session 17's mutations of Obj_TerrainEvent's mech side (terrain.c),
Unit_CreateCarried (units.c), UnitAI_Update's group step (unit_ai.c) and
the call in Mech_Update. Expected NOT CAUGHT (equivalent): "pick-up:
robots too" (form 1 is always a jet), "damage: dying hurt again" (a dying
mech never reaches its move), "dispatch: flow not cleared" (Mech_Update
has cleared it), "call: always" (no event: type 0 does nothing)."""

